  req1 task=385 prompt=31988 cached=31573 (99%) reproc=415 f_keep=0.986 prefill=142.6t/s (3s) decode=13.29t/s gen=181 draft=0.782 ctx_end=32169
  SUMMARY reqs=1 cached_frac=0.987 max_ctx=32169 prefill_s_total=3
ANS: - **llama.cpp (llama-server)**: `35b`, `gguf8`, `gguf6`, `gguf5`, `gguf4` - **MLX (mlx_vlm.server)**: `mlx8`, `mlx6`, `mlx4`, `optiq4`, `mxfp8`  That split comes from `model_engine()` (llm-serve:118), which routes the five MLX aliases to MLX and everything else (`35b` + the unsloth GGUFs) to llama.c
